Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:37.96,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:36.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:43.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.40,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.60,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:43.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:49.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.88,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:49.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:55.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:55.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:02.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:02.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:08.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:08.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:16.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:16.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:20.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:20.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:24.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:24.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:30.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:30.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:33.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:37.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:42.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:42.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:49.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:49.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
